{
  "rationale": "The plant automata model the robot's motion capabilities and perception outcomes. The specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative but non-oscillatory recovery, and ensure that exploration dominates behavior. Recovery actions are short and directed, with full_rotate and move_backward reserved for last-resort or dedicated recovery states only.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate motion and perception into distinct plant automata for clarity and modularity.",
    "Specification automata bind perception outcomes to allowed actions, enforce one-shot recovery, and prevent unsafe or oscillatory behaviors, ensuring forward progress is prioritized and recovery is conservative."
